{"agent_id":"pp3g-yAv3-independent-review-recommend-which-read-only-bash-94ab","agent_seq":5,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T02:00:04.024977020Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"47d06227-00cd-4477-b882-e8cb1a0d0b48","comment_uuid":"663d621a-0314-488b-aaf2-43018f3533a9","author":"pp3g-yAv3-independent-review-recommend-which-read-only-bash-94ab","content":"Plan: Analyze which read-only bash tools should be added to the Orchestrator allowlist. I will examine the four categories (monitoring, verification, coordination across repos, system health), cross-reference with the playbook's stalled-agent detection requirement (ps), and produce a single verdict comment with tool-by-tool rationale. No file modifications will be made.","created_at":"2026-08-03T02:00:04.016293022Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:r4jFu3PjvMkgrFLmX7K1h9PCfQawEJ3siuFKWmBaGws","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgIXs3oRACJlbaSAZJOHJrLtHPxNTJBUl7phT1KJuRe9MAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAjYvlxnpOrVrztsOpazqxpZduQkyJH43A/L/t2pXsPBl8hL18RhZ36D5ipO0I1/V+NgqI35sIVgnicm2jwBwnAg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:r4jFu3PjvMkgrFLmX7K1h9PCfQawEJ3siuFKWmBaGws","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgIXs3oRACJlbaSAZJOHJrLtHPxNTJBUl7phT1KJuRe9MAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGs0+Pw+XUZKirbCjmIMv5rEQ1eCrg22A5xKJeb36KFJyKWKQ75Y02Yp8DqT5zG8tp8+tP0Cx2YTNpTSyObLtQ0="}
{"agent_id":"pp3g-yAv3-independent-review-recommend-which-read-only-bash-94ab","agent_seq":6,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T02:00:09.932329988Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"47d06227-00cd-4477-b882-e8cb1a0d0b48","comment_uuid":"0c69e2d1-dfb8-4818-8609-8fed35f0cb64","author":"pp3g-yAv3-independent-review-recommend-which-read-only-bash-94ab","content":"[PROGRESS] state=working completed=plan posted next=post verdict comment blocker=none","created_at":"2026-08-03T02:00:09.925132064Z","kind":"observation","signed_by":"SHA256:r4jFu3PjvMkgrFLmX7K1h9PCfQawEJ3siuFKWmBaGws","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgIXs3oRACJlbaSAZJOHJrLtHPxNTJBUl7phT1KJuRe9MAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAtX3rtHHhI2p7xsmJLXBmwaHtqKPegfj9kjMFP9qwaA/JvB/11KfxhRj+/F9ZbHyadn55CNs7F1JxD+PSpSEQCA=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:r4jFu3PjvMkgrFLmX7K1h9PCfQawEJ3siuFKWmBaGws","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgIXs3oRACJlbaSAZJOHJrLtHPxNTJBUl7phT1KJuRe9MAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLjyiXlrlnT4OaoYsE/7J2EgM+FJfPBxibZw9ftQMBpKar9J6RA245abkYA9/Zo6fjuktuPXPT3QHDuuwp2Zogg="}
{"agent_id":"pp3g-yAv3-independent-review-recommend-which-read-only-bash-94ab","agent_seq":7,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T02:00:28.708746186Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"47d06227-00cd-4477-b882-e8cb1a0d0b48","comment_uuid":"76fc327c-0d50-469d-97f3-f7aac76dc3d8","author":"pp3g-yAv3-independent-review-recommend-which-read-only-bash-94ab","content":"VERDICT: Add the following read-only bash tools to the Orchestrator allowlist, grouped by category:\n\n**Monitoring (distinguish working from stalled):**\n1. ps — The playbook (§6.1) explicitly requires `ps -o pid,etime,time,stat -p <pid>` to distinguish stalled from working agents. TIME column climbing = computing; frozen + old heartbeat = stalled. Without ps, the orchestrator cannot detect dead agents. This is the single most critical addition.\n2. tmux list-sessions — Kickoff agents run in tmux sessions; the orchestrator must check session liveness. Read-only.\n3. tmux list-windows — Check tmux window states for agent health. Read-only.\n4. tmux capture-pane — Read agent output from tmux panes for verification. Read-only.\n5. tmux display-message — Get tmux server/session info. Read-only.\n\n**Verification:**\n6. grep — Search output/logs for error patterns, test results, pass/fail markers. Essential for result validation. Read-only.\n7. diff — Compare files/results (e.g., expected vs actual). Essential for verification. Read-only.\n8. tail — Read the end of log files and agent output streams. Read-only.\n9. head — Read the beginning of files for quick inspection. Read-only.\n10. wc — Count lines/words to verify output completeness. Read-only.\n11. stat — Check file metadata (timestamps, sizes) to verify artifact freshness. Read-only.\n\n**Coordination across repos:**\nNo new tools needed — crosslink already handles repo coordination (kickoff/swarm across worktrees, hub branch sync). Adding ssh or curl would introduce mutation risk.\n\n**System health:**\n12. free — Memory usage monitoring. Read-only.\n13. df — Disk space monitoring. Read-only.\n14. uptime — System load/uptime for health checks. Read-only.\n15. date — Timestamps for coordination and log correlation. Read-only.\n\n**Verification/debugging:**\n16. which — Verify tool availability before delegating. Read-only.\n17. env — Display environment for debugging delegation issues. Read-only.\n\nTools NOT recommended (mutation risk): curl (can POST/write to remote endpoints), ssh (can execute remote commands), sqlite3 (can write to databases), find (can be used with -exec to mutate), kill (mutates process state).\n\nRationale summary: ps is the #1 priority (playbook explicitly mandates it for stalled-agent detection). tmux subcommands are needed because kickoff agents run in tmux sessions. grep/diff/tail/head/wc/stat form the verification toolkit. free/df/uptime/date cover system health. which/env support debugging. No mutation-risk tools are recommended.","created_at":"2026-08-03T02:00:28.702737668Z","kind":"observation","signed_by":"SHA256:r4jFu3PjvMkgrFLmX7K1h9PCfQawEJ3siuFKWmBaGws","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgIXs3oRACJlbaSAZJOHJrLtHPxNTJBUl7phT1KJuRe9MAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA0j2+X/m02v3uGgX/WM7DxX98btbEDbX1xtUPSsrWSTkGaDu6o2fEJt4ICKhgK33fsS46p9XdIar1lruqbQ1pDw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:r4jFu3PjvMkgrFLmX7K1h9PCfQawEJ3siuFKWmBaGws","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgIXs3oRACJlbaSAZJOHJrLtHPxNTJBUl7phT1KJuRe9MAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPs4JtBXLaNF6yUzoyCmzX+6sBmjCD3ZBoJA6SKea8Ec7uu3zBlKoPYwHMYbPoMwVdJZWRBcGc7Yk4n+Q02sTQA="}
